---
import WallpaperGallery from "@/components/WallpaperGallery.astro";
---
<section class="scene-hero manga-hero" data-home-hero aria-labelledby="home-title">
  <div class="shell scene-hero-inner">
    <div class="scene-intro">
      <p class="scene-eyebrow">PERSONAL DESKTOP <span>/</span> EST. 2023</p>
      <h1 id="home-title"><span class="scene-slash">/</span>Felix<br /><span class="scene-name">Ding<span class="scene-cursor" aria-hidden="true">_</span></span></h1>
      <p class="scene-tagline">写代码，也记录过程。</p>
      <p class="scene-description">从桌面软件到嵌入式设备，<br />在这里存放问题、解法与一点日常。</p>
      <div class="scene-actions"><a class="scene-button" href="#desktop">打开我的桌面</a><a class="scene-text-link" href="/blog/">阅读文章</a></div>
      <p class="scene-focus"><span>FOCUS</span><span data-rotating-role>C++ Systems</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-artwork"><div class="hero-artwork-label"><span>THE LITTLE THINGS I LIKE</span><span aria-hidden="true">✳</span></div><WallpaperGallery /><p class="hero-artwork-note"><span aria-hidden="true">✳</span> 代码之外，也有喜欢的世界。</p></div>
    <div class="scene-caption"><span>SOFTWARE & SYSTEMS ENGINEER</span><span>BUILD. LEARN. LEAVE A TRACE.</span></div>
    <a class="scene-scroll" href="#desktop"><span>向下探索我的桌面</span><span class="scroll-track" aria-hidden="true"></span></a>
  </div>
</section>
